window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>Shadows in the Moonlight</i> by Robert E. Howard is a gripping Conan the Barbarian adventure that plunges listeners into a world of sword and sorcery, dark magic, and primal survival.</p> <p>When Olivia flees her captor and crosses paths with Conan, the two embark on a perilous journey to a mysterious island haunted by pirates, monstrous beasts, and ancient ruins. Filled with action, intrigue, and Howard’s vivid prose, this fantasy classic captures the raw clash between civilization and barbarism while exploring themes of power, loyalty, and survival.</p> <p>Perfect for fans of epic fantasy, pulp adventures, and the legendary tales of Conan, <i>Shadows in the Moonlight</i> delivers thrilling battles and unforgettable characters under the eerie glow of moonlight.</p>"; 
